<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Leading edge of FastingWidget's fill, hosted by a ProgressBar (widget_fasting_bubble_edge) so
     the launcher runs it continuously on RenderThread. Two slow, out-of-phase liquid meniscus waves
     (λ=60 at 5.2s and λ=40 at 6.8s) create a gentle, non-repeating surface swell while soft bubbles
     continuously bud from the edge, drift upward and outward, and dissolve. All animations loop
     seamlessly; with system animations off, bubbles stay invisible (fillAlpha=0) over the calm edge.
     Viewport 24x120: x=0..8 continues the solid fill; x=8 is the resting edge; x=8..24 is the
     bubbling zone. -->
